cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and keep each stream's attribution field."
type: dataset
title: "Live Environment Streams"
abstract: >-
  GeoJSON dataset of public live camera streams (HLS, MJPEG, MP4) from road
  authorities, exported from a production 24/7 streaming pipeline, with a
  licence review per source. Built for AI agents, computer vision and
  weather monitoring.
authors:
